# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws [[cite:obs-0d7ccf26841bafcf1bf91b5e40010f8bfc6389b8 "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]].

Novels may be borrowed for twenty-one days and this period is renewable twice [[cite:obs-a8af5da0702f64a5a6b63589be5549e283343306 "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]].
